## Grammars <!-- .element: class="fragment fade-in" data-fragment-index="1" -->

</div>

```txt
expression:
    unary_op expression
    postfix_expression
    postfix_expression binary_op expression
    postfix_expression ';' expression
postfix_expression:
    primary_expression postfix_op*
primary_expression:
    identifier
    literal
    '(' expression ')'
```
